{"id":"659121","name":"红糖发面饼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659121/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"25g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3g"},{"name":"食用碱","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉里打入鸡蛋，放入酵母粉、白糖、食用碱（可以不放）。","img":"images/659121/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入适量的温水和成面团，加入一勺猪油，增加面的柔软性。","img":"images/659121/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团，盖上保鲜膜，常温发酵一个小时。","img":"images/659121/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"接下来调个馅料，碗内放入50g红糖、芝麻、2克面粉。","img":"images/659121/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀，馅就调好了。","img":"images/659121/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一小时后，面已发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/659121/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉面切剂子。","img":"images/659121/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀面皮。","img":"images/659121/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/659121/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"捏成包子状。","img":"images/659121/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/659121/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"轻轻擀扁。","img":"images/659121/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀成厚一点的饼。","img":"images/659121/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"依次全部做完。","img":"images/659121/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"平底锅热油，放入饼胚，表面再喷上油。","img":"images/659121/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"两面烙至金黄色。","img":"images/659121/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加入半碗水。","img":"images/659121/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"中小火焖5分钟。","img":"images/659121/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"时间到，面饼熟了。","img":"images/659121/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/659121/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"蓬松宣软。","img":"images/659121/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659121/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}